    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d366-a1-a1">

                <pb facs="0490" n="420" xml:id="pg420"/>

                <head>Mr. Chase to Mr. Stevens.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Treasury Department,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-05-23"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 23, 1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to transmit, herewith, a
                    copy of a letter from the Secretary of State to me, dated 20th instant, covering
                    translations of a letter addressed to him by the minister of France, M. Mercier,
                    and of a letter from the Chamber of Commerce of Lyons to the minister of trade
                    of France, relating to the bearing of our tariff on French silks, which is
                    represented to be unequal and injurious to French manufacturers.</p>
                <p>I am certain it will be the aim of Congress in forming the tariff bill now under
                    consideration to make its provisions bear with entire impartiality upon the
                    industrial interests of other nations, and I shall say this in my letter to the
                    Secretary of State, in advising him of the disposition I have made of the
                    letters of M. Mercier and of the Chamber of Commerce of Lyons.</p>
                <p>With great respect,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>S. P. CHASE, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of the
                        Treasury.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Thaddeus Stevens,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Chairman Com. of Ways and Means, House of
                        Reps.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d366-a1-a1-a1.xml" xpointer="d366-a1-a1-a1"/>
